  "The Checkout Attachment Module for eCommerceGo introduces a streamlined way for customers to add attachments during the checkout process. This module empowers customers to include essential documents or files related to their orders, such as design specifications, proof of identity, or personalized instructions. By allowing attachments at checkout, the module enhances the clarity and accuracy of orders, ensuring that all necessary information is captured upfront.": "Il modulo allegati di pagamento per eCommerceGo introduce un modo semplificato per consentire ai clienti di aggiungere allegati durante il processo di pagamento. ",
