  "Designed with user experience in mind, the Checkout Attachment Module makes adding attachments a straightforward and hassle-free process. During checkout, customers are presented with an easy-to-use interface to upload their files. Supported file types and size limits can be configured to suit your business needs, ensuring compatibility and efficiency. This user-friendly approach helps reduce friction in the checkout process, leading to higher customer satisfaction and fewer order discrepancies.": "Progettato pensando all'esperienza dell'utente, il modulo allegati di Checkout rende l'aggiunta di allegati un processo semplice e senza problemi. ",
  "Enhanced Communication with Administrators": "Comunicazione migliorata con gli amministratori",
